{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Getting Started"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"article","sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"text":"Setting up an Xcode project that uses MapLibre Native for iOS.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AddMarkerSymbolExample"],"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Create-a-new-iOS-project","text":"Create a new iOS project","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a new (SwiftUI) iOS project with Xcode. Go to "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"File > New > Project…","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Add-MapLibre-Native-as-a-dependency","text":"Add MapLibre Native as a dependency","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MapLibre Native for iOS is available on "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/cocoapods.org","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" and on the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/swiftpackageindex.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-gl-native-distribution","isActive":true},{"text":" (for use with the Swift Package Manager). However, for this guide we will add the MapLibre Native as a package dependency directly.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In Xcode, right click your project and select “Add Package Dependencies…”:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"AddPackageDependencies.png","type":"image"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Paste the following URL and click Add Package:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["https:\/\/g